{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06724","headline":"塞上曲 · 王昌龄","name":"塞上曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风夜渡河，吹却鴈门桑。\n遥见胡地猎，鞲马宿严霜。\n五道分兵去，孤军百战场。\n功多翻下狱，士卒但心伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“塞上曲”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“塞上曲”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}